OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment told to 'go faster' on
OL,4,AOxCam corridor
OL,5,
OL,6,FA report into the potential benefits of
OL,7,Fa growth corridor between Oxford and
OL,8,FCambridge has concluded it cannot
OL,9,Fbecome one of the top ten in the world
OL,10,Fwithout improving infrastructure and
OL,11,Ftransport.
OL,13,FThe findings from the business
OL,14,Fmanagement consultant Public First and
OL,15,Fthe supercluster board praised how
OL,16,F"research-intensive" the area is, but
OL,17,Ffound retaining talent and
OL,18,Fentrepreneurs was difficult.
OL,20,FPart of that was put down to the high
OL,21,Fcosts of rents and poor public
OL,22,Ftransport links.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
