OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment told to 'go faster' on
OL,4,AOxCam corridor
OL,5,
OL,6,FCallum Anderson, the Labour MP for
OL,7,FBuckingham and Bletchley said "the
OL,8,FOxCam corridor is a key part of our
OL,9,Fgrowth in every postcode" but
OL,10,Facknowledged there were barriers,
OL,11,Fpartly due to local government
OL,12,Fstructure.
